{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1382667-an-emanation-for-a-familiar","id":1382667,"title":"An emanation for a familiar?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-19T20:24:56-07:00","id":1382667,"title":"An emanation for a familiar?","content":"What would the likely effects be of making an emanation a familiar. Specifically, I\u2019m thinking of introducing an archmage who has a fae familiar from the Arcadian Gateway. Virtually all of them are emanations, and I\u2019m curious what sort of strength they would have as familiars at the beginning, and what their potential for growth would be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-19T21:07:17-07:00","id":1382674,"title":"","content":"Dudes an arch mage do whatever you want","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-19T22:13:35-07:00","id":1382682,"title":"","content":"Precisely. The Archmage essentially sounds like they make the Emanation &quot;real&quot; in the process of becoming a Familiar. But Emanations would be treated then as Full Blown Fae, or maybe a Changeling if part of the Familiar Process is making them a corporeal body.<br /> <br /> But I would say the Familiar of an Archmage would have the Growth potential of a full blown character. NPCs in the Arcadian Gateway can be represented with Changeling or Dark Age Fae rules after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-20T20:23:32-07:00","id":1382887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1382667-an-emanation-for-a-familiar?p=1382682#post1382682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Precisely. The Archmage essentially sounds like they make the Emanation &amp;quot;real&amp;quot; in the process of becoming a Familiar. But Emanations would be treated then as Full Blown Fae, or maybe a Changeling if part of the Familiar Process is making them a corporeal body.<br /> <br /> But I would say the Familiar of an Archmage would have the Growth potential of a full blown character. NPCs in the Arcadian Gateway can be represented with Changeling or Dark Age Fae rules after all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the replies, everyone. I appreciate the help while I work out the mechanics for what happens when a Fae emanation is given a body, and is spiritually anchored to a mage and a physical form rather than just the Arcadian Gateway. It is my understanding that the emanations are purely extensions of the realm that they are a part of, so I\u2019m not sure if they should get the same rules as regular spirits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-20T21:08:06-07:00","id":1382894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1382667-an-emanation-for-a-familiar?p=1382887#post1382887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks for the replies, everyone. I appreciate the help while I work out the mechanics for what happens when a Fae emanation is given a body, and is spiritually anchored to a mage and a physical form rather than just the Arcadian Gateway. It is my understanding that the emanations are purely extensions of the realm that they are a part of, so I\u2019m not sure if they should get the same rules as regular spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div>An emanation of a Fae put in a material body sounds an awful lot like a modern changeling. So I would model it using a changeling. If you want to limit them don't allow them to grow after you create their initial powers. But Its believed several of the Emanations in the Arcadian Gateway used to be Fae Spirits that turned into Umbral Emanations after the Fae left Earth with the Shattering.<br /> <br /> Or the boring way is just make a normal Familiar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}